  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Zones v2.0",
    "description": "The dataset consists of health zone boundaries with name, location, and other related attributes for eleven provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo. Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. The current version supersedes GRID3 COD - Health Zones v1.0 (https://doi.org/10.7916/hkxs-nn48). This current version includes the province of Kasaï-Central. Keywords: health areas, health zones",
